# Contact form email delivery (optional until you're ready to wire it up).
# Without RESEND_API_KEY, /api/contact returns 503 and the form shows a
# "email isn't connected yet" message with a mailto: link.
# Set these in Vercel -> Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables.

# 1. Create a free account at https://resend.com and make an API key.
RESEND_API_KEY=

# 2. Sender address. Leave unset to use Resend's shared onboarding sender for
#    first tests; for production verify your own domain and set e.g.
#    "Dinesh Sharma <hello@yourdomain.com>".
CONTACT_FROM=
